  "title": "Unified Title",
  "summary": "PopPert and SCALE both address the challenge of predicting transcriptional responses from unpaired single-cell populations, leveraging population-level joint distribution modeling and conditional transport to enable perturbation-specific predictions across different types of perturbations.",
